{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 2769 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "5268970d7b3fb76650d07f5fc8fc57df21c0ea6cea798b233fe1fe4ff0e58996" :edb/db-before-t 2768 :edb/db-after-t 2769 :edb/tx-data [[13194139536081 50 #inst "2026-10-09T14:33:41.800Z" 13194139536081 true] [17592186087639 1020 #edb/ref 17592186382670 13194139536081 true] [17592186087640 1020 #edb/ref 17592186382665 13194139536081 true] [17592186382665 1017 #edb/ref 17592186382666 13194139536081 true] [17592186382665 1017 #edb/ref 17592186382668 13194139536081 true] [17592186382665 1089 "q-316829" 13194139536081 true] [17592186382665 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139536081 true] [17592186382665 1100 "Let $B=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -x+7 \\\\ x-5 & 0\\end{aligned}]$\nbe a singular matrix. **In ascending order**, the values of $x$ are\n\n$x=$\n{{field-1}}$\\,$ and $\\,x=$\n{{field-2}}." 13194139536081 true] [17592186382665 1113 #uuid "5de2acf0-9418-52f4-b9a6-27b23fa60b6c" 13194139536081 true] [17592186382665 1145 "The matrix $B$ is singular if and only if $det(B)=0.$ Calculating the determinant, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(B) & =3\\cdot 0-(-x+7)\\cdot (x-5) \\\\  & ={x}^{2}-5x-7x+35 \\\\  & ={x}^{2}-12x+35.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we set the determinant equal to $0$ and solve for $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-12x+35 & =0 \\\\ (x-7)(x-5) & =0 \\\\ x & =7,5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, in ascending order, the values of $x$ are\n\n$$\nx=5\\,\\text{and}\\,x=7.\n$$" 13194139536081 true] [17592186382666 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382667 13194139536081 true] [17592186382666 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139536081 true] [17592186382666 1041 "field-1" 13194139536081 true] [17592186382666 1104 #edb/ref 17592186382667 13194139536081 true] [17592186382666 1110 #uuid "588d26c3-4d17-54ae-b871-0fb44f1739ac" 13194139536081 true] [17592186382667 1034 "5" 13194139536081 true] [17592186382667 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536081 true] [17592186382667 1111 #uuid "2c784e1e-459d-509b-9622-86a5898d3c23" 13194139536081 true] [17592186382668 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382669 13194139536081 true] [17592186382668 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139536081 true] [17592186382668 1041 "field-2" 13194139536081 true] [17592186382668 1104 #edb/ref 17592186382669 13194139536081 true] [17592186382668 1110 #uuid "0b465e1f-321f-5e89-a053-c0bcd5500b59" 13194139536081 true] [17592186382669 1034 "7" 13194139536081 true] [17592186382669 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536081 true] [17592186382669 1111 #uuid "9d7f55c7-be1d-5e79-b8af-61d91cb82c12" 13194139536081 true] [17592186382670 1017 #edb/ref 17592186382671 13194139536081 true] [17592186382670 1089 "q-71935" 13194139536081 true] [17592186382670 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139536081 true] [17592186382670 1100 "Which of the matrices below are singular?\n\n$$\nN=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}],\\,V=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}],\\,Z=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 8 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{aligned}].\n$$" 13194139536081 true] [17592186382670 1113 #uuid "5f5bb9d1-db59-54f4-aa53-0a0fa0a6f6c0" 13194139536081 true] [17592186382670 1145 "- For the matrix $N$, we have\n\n$$\ndet(N)=3\\cdot 0-0\\cdot 1=0.\n$$\n\nBecause $det(N)=0,$ we conclude that $N$ is not invertible. Since $N$ is a square matrix that is not invertible, we also say that $N$ is singular.\n\n- The matrix $V$ is a $5\\times 1$ matrix. So, it is not invertible. Since the matrix is not square, we can't say that it's singular.\n\n- For the matrix $Z$, we have\n\n$$\ndet(Z)=0\\cdot 0-2\\cdot 8=-16.\n$$\n\nBecause $det(Z)\\ne 0,$ we conclude that $Z$ is invertible.\n\nTherefore, only $N$ is singular." 13194139536081 true] [17592186382671 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382672 13194139536081 true] [17592186382671 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382673 13194139536081 true] [17592186382671 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382674 13194139536081 true] [17592186382671 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382675 13194139536081 true] [17592186382671 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382676 13194139536081 true] [17592186382671 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536081 true] [17592186382671 1041 "selection" 13194139536081 true] [17592186382671 1104 #edb/ref 17592186382674 13194139536081 true] [17592186382671 1110 #uuid "ac0bcc82-7aad-5f54-ab32-0edb3e2d8e04" 13194139536081 true] [17592186382672 1034 "$Z$ only" 13194139536081 true] [17592186382672 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536081 true] [17592186382672 1111 #uuid "51a60d9c-e5a7-5a76-b0fd-994eda482900" 13194139536081 true] [17592186382673 1034 "$V$ and $Z$ only" 13194139536081 true] [17592186382673 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536081 true] [17592186382673 1111 #uuid "79e7c4ae-51f8-5c49-83c7-9764c072dc4b" 13194139536081 true] [17592186382674 1034 "$N$ only" 13194139536081 true] [17592186382674 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536081 true] [17592186382674 1111 #uuid "6b084eae-6588-5efa-8c6b-6329ed2a8264" 13194139536081 true] [17592186382675 1034 "$N$ and $V$ only" 13194139536081 true] [17592186382675 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536081 true] [17592186382675 1111 #uuid "d333a178-720a-57b7-ab5e-07daebcd2af3" 13194139536081 true] [17592186382676 1034 "$N$ and $Z$ only" 13194139536081 true] [17592186382676 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536081 true] [17592186382676 1111 #uuid "ff91e5e1-d20a-50fa-abd2-dbd390595a95" 13194139536081 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-316829" 17592186382665 "q-316829/field-1" 17592186382666 "q-316829/field-1/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" 17592186382667 "q-316829/field-2" 17592186382668 "q-316829/field-2/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" 17592186382669 "q-71935" 17592186382670 "q-71935/selection" 17592186382671 "q-71935/selection/9271c1026b9fd2e189ef39350f9a41159873b5bc0ead6717e38e78c613348fc6" 17592186382672 "q-71935/selection/d0c27d2d47df83ee9fc78485ce4212cd19ca52dd3c5e33249ff19e73785be56e" 17592186382673 "q-71935/selection/d421789580120bcffa463cceff044cf15d8c8013848684a3dbaada77227e0536" 17592186382674 "q